# Discovery CSS — FROZEN foundation (Session 0)

**Spec:** `docs/architecture/discovery-specs/00-FOUNDATION.md`  
**SSOT sheet:** `app/styles/discovery.css` (extracted from `docs/architecture/discovery.html`)  
**Build order:** `docs/architecture/discovery-specs/README.md`

## Read-only after Session 0

- **Do not edit** `app/styles/discovery.css` while building pages 1–8.
- **Do not add** page-level CSS overrides that restyle `.tw-*` foundation classes (including growing `discovery-suite.css` overrides).
- If a class the page needs is **missing** from the foundation sheet → **stop and tell the user**. Fix only by reopening Session 0 / Architecture reopen — never a one-off override.

## Page sessions

One page per session, order `1→5` sequential; page **4** (quotation detail) alone; page **2** before **5** (creator modal). Pages `6–8` anytime after foundation.

Prompt pattern: read `00-FOUNDATION.md`, then the page file; build only that page; do not modify `discovery.css`.

## Traps

- No handlers named `open` / `close` / `print` / `focus` / `name` / `stop` (shadows `document.open`).
- Every inline SVG needs CSS width/height/`fill:none`.
- Class-coverage must include every overlay state, not only the default view.
- `—` ≠ `0`; empty brand → `not set` / `.tw-miss`.
